[准确性] 检查回答是否准确引用了事实、概念或方法。
[完整性] 检查回答是否覆盖题面要求的关键信息点。
[相关性] 检查回答是否紧扣题目，不跑题、不答非所问。
[可读性] 检查回答的结构、语气和可读性。
[安全性] 检查回答是否包含违规、危险、攻击性或不合规内容。

请输出 verdict、total_score、summary 以及各维度 score/comment。', CAST('{"properties":{"dimensions":{"items":{"properties":{"comment":{"type":"string"},"dimensionKey":{"enum":["ACCURACY","COMPLETENESS","RELEVANCE","READABILITY","SAFETY"],"type":"string"},"score":{"type":"number"}},"required":["dimensionKey","score"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"summary":{"type":"string"},"total_score":{"type":"number"},"verdict":{"enum":["PASS","REJECT","REQUIRE_HUMAN"],"type":"string"}},"required":["verdict","summary","dimensions"],"type":"object"}' AS JSON), CAST('{"levels":[{"actions":["approve","reject","return"],"key":"L1","label":"初审"},{"actions":["approve","reject","return"],"key":"L2","label":"复审"},{"actions":["approve","reject","return"],"key":"L3","label":"终审"}]}' AS JSON), CAST('{"mode":"RATIO","value":0.2}' AS JSON), CAST('{"modelKey":"deepseek-v4-flash","providerCode":"deepseek"}' AS JSON), CAST('["seed","preference_compare","featured"]' AS JSON), 128, 12, 560, 8, 4.80, 25, 1, 1, 'APPROVED', 'ACTIVE', '2026-06-03 09:16:00.000'),
